  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Versioned form contracts for trusted visual ADR creation and editing adapters.\nNative-template discovery, side-effect-free preview, atomic creation and conflict-safe in-place updates.\nPreserves unknown Markdown sections, existing filenames and identifiers during focused edits.\nPreserves existing command-line behavior, canonical defaults, JSON/SARIF, impact, drift, review and Action contracts.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/rodri-oliveira-dev/adr-guard/releases/tag/v1.7.0",
